                                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><article class="compatibility-contract-card contract-database h-100"><h4><i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i>@Localizer["Policy and implementation"]</h4><div data-embedding-notes></div></article></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row g-3 mt-3">
                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                                <article class="aux-operation-card h-100">
                                    <div class="aux-operation-heading"><span><i class="fas fa-pen-nib"></i></span><div><small>@Localizer["Narrow operation"]</small><h5>Ollama Generate</h5></div><span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">@Localizer["Ollama only"]</span></div>
                                    <code>POST /api/generate</code>
                                    <p>@Localizer["Ollama JSON/NDJSON stays in the native dialect; model identity, answer, finish data, and usage are observed and rewritten."]</p>
                                    <div class="aux-operation-limit"><i class="fas fa-ban"></i>@Localizer["No Chat Completions or Responses translation. A non-Ollama backend returns <code>501</code>."]</div>
                                </article>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
                                <article class="aux-operation-card h-100">
                                    <div class="aux-operation-heading"><span><i class="fas fa-compass"></i></span><div><small>@Localizer["Gateway-owned operation"]</small><h5>@Localizer["Model discovery"]</h5></div><span class="badge bg-info text-dark">@Localizer["No upstream call"]</span></div>
                                    <div class="aux-endpoints"><code>/v1/models*</code><code>/api/tags</code><code>/api/ps</code><code>/api/version</code></div>
                                    <p>@Localizer["Virtual-model names and gateway-owned metadata are rendered directly in the requested client shape."]</p>
                                    <div class="aux-operation-limit"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>@Localizer["Physical provider metadata is not proxied; Ollama runtime details are placeholders or omitted."]</div>
                                </article>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="d-none" aria-hidden="true" data-aux-route-catalog>
                            <table>
                                <tbody>
                                    <tr data-aux-route="openai-embedding-to-openai" data-mode="transparent"><th>@Localizer["OpenAI embedding input"]</th><td>@Localizer["OpenAI-type Provider"]</td><td>@Localizer["The original request and successful response JSON are cloned; unknown OpenAI embedding fields are preserved; only model identity is rewritten."]</td><td>@Localizer["No chat protocol translation occurs. Backend <code>Protocol</code> is not consulted for embeddings."]</td><td>@Localizer["<code>OpenAiEmbeddingClientAdapter</code> + <code>OpenAiEmbeddingProviderAdapter</code>. No VM sampling/context override is injected into an OpenAI embedding request."]</td></tr>
                                    <tr data-aux-route="openai-embedding-to-ollama" data-mode="translated"><th>@Localizer["OpenAI embedding input"]</th><td>@Localizer["Ollama-type Provider"]</td><td>@Localizer["OpenAI <code>input</code> is sent as Ollama <code>input</code>; <code>embeddings[]</code> and <code>prompt_eval_count</code> are reconstructed as OpenAI <code>data[]</code> and <code>usage</code>."]</td><td>@Localizer["OpenAI embedding extensions outside the shared input are not copied into the cross-dialect request or reconstructed response."]</td><td>@Localizer["VM <code>NumCtx</code>, <code>Temperature</code>, <code>TopP</code>, <code>TopK</code>, and <code>RepeatPenalty</code> are injected into Ollama <code>options</code>."]</td></tr>
                                    <tr data-aux-route="ollama-embedding-to-openai" data-mode="translated"><th>@Localizer["Ollama embedding input"]</th><td>@Localizer["OpenAI-type Provider"]</td><td>@Localizer["Ollama <code>input</code> or legacy <code>prompt</code> becomes OpenAI <code>input</code>; OpenAI <code>data[].embedding</code> is reconstructed as Ollama <code>embeddings[]</code>."]</td><td>@Localizer["Ollama-only embedding fields such as <code>options</code>, <code>truncate</code>, <code>dimensions</code> variants, and <code>keep_alive</code> are not copied into the OpenAI request unless represented by the shared input."]</td><td>@Localizer["Provider adapter selection uses <code>ProviderType</code>, not chat <code>BackendProtocol</code>. No Ollama VM options are injected into an OpenAI embedding target."]</td></tr>
                                    <tr data-aux-route="ollama-embedding-to-ollama" data-mode="transparent"><th>@Localizer["Ollama embedding input"]</th><td>@Localizer["Ollama-type Provider"]</td><td>@Localizer["The original request and successful response JSON are cloned; unknown fields are preserved; model identity is rewritten."]</td><td>@Localizer["The provider-level <code>keep_alive</code> replaces the client value on this route."]</td><td>@Localizer["VM <code>NumCtx</code>, <code>Temperature</code>, <code>TopP</code>, <code>TopK</code>, and <code>RepeatPenalty</code> hard-override Ollama <code>options</code>."]</td></tr>
                                    <tr data-aux-route="ollama-generate"><th><code>POST /api/generate</code></th><td>@Localizer["Ollama Native only"]</td><td>@Localizer["Ollama generate JSON/NDJSON is forwarded in the same dialect; model identity, answer text, finish data, and usage are observed and the virtual model name is restored."]</td><td>@Localizer["There is no Chat Completions or Responses translation. A non-Ollama backend returns <code>501</code>."]</td><td>@Localizer["VM Thinking, NumCtx, Temperature, TopP, TopK, NumPredict, and RepeatPenalty override the request; missing <code>keep_alive</code> uses the Provider value."]</td></tr>
                                    <tr data-aux-route="model-discovery"><th>@Localizer["Model discovery endpoints"]</th><td>@Localizer["Gateway-generated response"]</td><td>@Localizer["Virtual-model names and gateway-owned metadata are rendered directly in the requested client shape."]</td><td>@Localizer["These endpoints do not proxy physical provider metadata. Ollama size/digest/runtime details are placeholders or omitted."]</td><td>@Localizer["This avoids recursive upstream discovery when a Provider points back to the gateway and keeps the public catalog scoped to virtual models."]</td></tr>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
    </div>
</section>

